{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19183","headline":"和令狐相公送赵常盈链师与中贵人同拜岳及天台投龙毕却赴京 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公送赵常盈链师与中贵人同拜岳及天台投龙毕却赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银璫谒者引蜺旌，霞帔仙官到赤城。\n白鹤迎来天乐动，金龙掷下海神惊。\n元君伏奏归中禁，武帝亲斋礼上清。\n何事夷门请诗送，梁王文字上声名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}